## 資料流總覽

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant WebUI as 手機 Web UI
    participant RPi as RPi FastAPI
    participant BG as CV181X 背景執行緒
    participant TDL as CV181X TDL Thread

    Note over WebUI,TDL: === 註冊流程 (Enroll) ===
    WebUI->>RPi: POST /api/enroll (照片+姓名+description+valid_date)
    RPi->>RPi: 存照片, 建 pending 記錄
    BG->>RPi: GET /api/pending
    RPi-->>BG: [{id, name, photo_path, valid_date, description}]
    BG->>BG: 下載照片到 /tmp
    BG->>TDL: PendingTask_t (含 description)
    TDL->>TDL: ArcFace → BioHash → enroll_v2()
    TDL->>TDL: K = random_key, sketch = B⊕BCH(K), commitment = SHA256(K)
    TDL->>TDL: encrypted_payload = AES-CTR(K, description)
    TDL->>BG: CompletedTask_t {template_hex, encrypted_payload_hex}
    BG->>RPi: POST /api/persons/{id}/complete {biohash_template, encrypted_payload}

    Note over WebUI,TDL: === 驗證流程 (Verify) ===
    TDL->>RPi: GET /api/templates
    RPi-->>TDL: [{id, name, biohash_template, encrypted_payload}]
    TDL->>TDL: ArcFace → BioHash → verify_multiple_v2()
    TDL->>TDL: C' = B'⊕sketch → BCH decode → K* → SHA256(K*)==commitment?
    TDL->>TDL: AES-CTR(K*, encrypted_payload) → 解密出 description
    TDL->>TDL: RTSP 顯示: ✅ Alice | ABC科技
```

